    "One of the two photographs is secretly misexposed"
  ],
  "answer": 1,
  "why": "Each dial controls the light AND something else — aperture depth of field, shutter motion, ISO noise. Same bucket level, entirely different photographs; neither is 'more correct'."
};

const expDialSort = {
